  "details": "Description\n\nI can't type properly. Even though I pressed Y, I am able to type text in the input box, but neither I nor others can see what I typed. I've reinstalled the game and verified the file integrity, yet nothing worked. I need functional typing to communicate.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nReproduction steps:\n\n \n\n1. Press Y.\n\n2. Click the chat box with the mouse.\n\n3. Type text. Other players cannot see the message.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Networking\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1918-8b1f448883-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-30_16-03-43.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_c78a95ef-bf96-4b9f-bf9a-47719ab41065/1/file)",
